      "data": {
        "label": "EXAMPLE (leaf) — Identity Service internals. Layer 3 of the security-rollup demo.\nThese three components carry the real, hand-entered probability/consequence assessments. Their rolled-up \"Threat score\" per threat is what the Services layer (domain-customer.chd) shows for the linked \"Identity Service\" column.\n\"Insider misuse\" is assessed here but NOT in the parent catalog — the Services matrix surfaces it as a note rather than a row."
      }
    },
